{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"accusations\": [\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"Syrkin-Nikolau 等，关于步态冻结期间β频段功率变化的原始研究\",\n      \"pmid\": \"28890315\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"report_says\": \"实际冻结（实际FOG发作）期间β功率呈上升，与评委引用的原始研究结果相反。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"原始研究实际报告的是冻结期间β功率下降。X直接引用了该原始研究，而Y主要通过电生理综述（PMID:33240199）转述了相反的结果。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"14例帕金森病患者胆碱能PET研究\",\n      \"pmid\": \"40512756\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"report_says\": \"将这项14例患者的胆碱能PET研究引用为PMID:40635563。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"PMID:40635563实际对应的是一篇关于帕金森病疾病修饰试验的综述，并非胆碱能PET研究。该PET研究的正确PMID是40512756。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"关于转弯期间神经耦合变化与冻结关系的研究\",\n      \"pmid\": \"41131028\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"report_says\": \"认为该研究内部统计结果不一致，存在统计矛盾。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"原文区分了正常转弯阶段TurnPre与冻结转弯阶段TurnStart的耦合变化，并报告TurnPre阶段耦合增强与较短的冻结时间相关。这些结果可以通过不同时间阶段的差异解释，不应简单认定为统计矛盾。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "dc4e402b-b499-435c-a18f-e5f96c4aee95", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T114011990751Z", "elapsed_seconds": 26.344, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T11:40:38.339929+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c72f5fd757568a9520f20c3919531729571c73e5f52b4b0a4bd3e1ba880d3d45", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http"